Package: SEARS2
Type: Package
Title: SEARS 2.0: Decision-Specific Evidence Authority for Dose Optimization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Haitao", "Pan", email = "haitaopan@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the SEARS 2.0 evidence-to-dose-decision framework for
    early-phase dose optimization. The package represents decision-specific
    evidence authority, claim-specific posterior evidence, directed dominance,
    four final decision states, and lightweight simulation utilities. The
    defaults reproduce the frozen manuscript design and are examples rather
    than universal clinical constants.
